    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "30fa5c23_aebbf81b",
        "filename": "src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/NetworkScanRequestTracker.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 408,
      "author": {
        "id": 1148298
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-06-05T17:07:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because \"interrupt\" acts in a similar way of \"stop\", in both doInterruptScan() and doStopScan(), the first step is to check whether the requested \"scanId\" matches the stored scan requests, so \"interrupt\" and \"stop\" command won\u0027t be sent to the modem before the \"start\" commend.",
      "parentUuid": "6db4f37c_60b9170b",
      "revId": "b8d9ea1feac6b44ec64d0558eb93d5f672f41d5f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4ac78662_27a1dc2b",
        "filename": "src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/NetworkScanRequestTracker.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 408,
      "author": {
        "id": 1054648
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-06-06T01:32:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed that interrupt wont do anything, but do you want to call start when binder died and the request was meant to be interrupted?",
      "parentUuid": "30fa5c23_aebbf81b",
      "revId": "b8d9ea1feac6b44ec64d0558eb93d5f672f41d5f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6312058d_be52951b",
        "filename": "src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/NetworkScanRequestTracker.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 408,
      "author": {
        "id": 1148298
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-06-06T03:52:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "it seems weird to me to send a \"start\" command when the binder died, for example, if there is a live scan running and binder died, if we start a new scan before interrupt, this new scan will actually fail and do nothing since there is already a scan running.",
      "parentUuid": "4ac78662_27a1dc2b",
      "revId": "b8d9ea1feac6b44ec64d0558eb93d5f672f41d5f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
